             17  *
             18  *                               100
             19  *                               PLC
             20  *
             21  *                               0
             22  *
             23  * CALLING SEQUENCE:
             24  *
             25  *       BL @SFSN
             26  *
             27  *      IN  - R1 = #
             28  *      OUT - R8 = PLC
             29  *
             30  *      NORMAL EXIT - RETURN
             31  *      ERROR EXIT TO ERROR ROUTINE
             32  *
             33  * EXCEPTIONS AND CONDITIONS:
             34  *
             35  *       ERROR 13 RESULTS IF LINE IS NOT FOUND
